# I47 (REVIEW-PHASE1-R20): the agent's build outputs must not ride into the
# verified commit (the commit is pushed to the repo by S6 delivery). The
# runner's commitWorkspace refuses any NEW file over 1 MiB or binary — but
# the SEED repo should carry its own .gitignore so build/test artifacts
# are ignored at staging time (the runner's guard is the backstop for a
# .gitignore-less workspace). This file is committed into the seeded repo
# (hack/samples-seed.sh seeds from the committed tree), so the pylib Loop's
# workspace has it from the base commit.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
